# Leave both unset and the board lives in each browser's localStorage — fine for
# one person on one machine.
#
# Set them and every window (Desk, Console, every teammate's browser) reads and
# writes one shared record through the relay in ./relay.
# VITE_STORAGE_URL=https://stripe-sync.yourname.workers.dev
# VITE_STORAGE_TOKEN=the-same-string-you-set-as-SYNC_TOKEN
